OL,3,GNEWSAHow Queen perfected trademark
OL,4,Aharmonies in a cave
OL,5,
OL,6,FQueen drummer Roger Taylor has recalled
OL,7,Fhow his mum organised the band's first
OL,8,Fever concert to raise funds for the
OL,9,FBritish Red Cross.
OL,11,FThe show in Truro in June 1970 featured
OL,12,FTaylor on drums, Brian May on guitar
OL,13,Fand vocals by Freddie Mercury, then
OL,14,Fknown as Fred Bulsara.
OL,16,FTaylor also revealed how the group
OL,17,Fperfected their trademark harmonies by
OL,18,Fsinging in a cave on a Cornish beach
OL,19,Fbecause they loved the "big sound".
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
